WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.878 --> 00:00:17.580
and Mandy hid behind the church benches and watched the two men.

2
00:00:18.781 --> 00:00:22.281
Columbus put his book down and hugged the other man.

3
00:00:22.301 --> 00:00:25.702
"Thank you, Martin Alonzo," he said.

4
00:00:25.722 --> 00:00:28.463
"We have much to do before sailing."

5
00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:31.324
"The Pinzon family is with you!

6
00:00:31.924 --> 00:00:35.067
The sailors are ready too," said Martin Alonzo.

7
00:00:36.428 --> 00:00:38.490
The two men hurried out of the church.

8
00:00:40.411 --> 00:00:42.153
They never noticed the children.

9
00:00:42.173 --> 00:00:46.116
"Do you think he's really Christopher Columbus?"

10
00:00:46.677 --> 00:00:47.998
asked Vinnie excitedly.

11
00:00:48.018 --> 00:00:51.060
"Hey, he left his book!"

12
00:00:51.661 --> 00:00:53.903
cried Mandy, running to pick it up.

13
00:00:53.923 --> 00:00:59.968
"The Travels of Marco Polo," Mandy read on the cover.

14
00:01:01.212 --> 00:01:02.793
She flipped through the pages.

15
00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:07.135
"Whoever he is, he must love this book.

16
00:01:08.536 --> 00:01:11.618
He's written in it and underlined some parts."

17
00:01:13.219 --> 00:01:14.059
Mandy stopped.

18
00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.681
She thought she heard a noise.

19
00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.862
"What was that?"

20
00:01:19.442 --> 00:01:19.982
she said.

21
00:01:20.002 --> 00:01:22.604
"What was what?"

22
00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:23.744
asked Vinnie.

23
00:01:24.805 --> 00:01:27.727
A young man stepped out from behind a stone column.

24
00:01:30.576 --> 00:01:31.616
Vinnie screamed.

25
00:01:32.977 --> 00:01:33.737
"Shh! Quiet!"

26
00:01:34.257 --> 00:01:35.237
said the young man.

27
00:01:36.398 --> 00:01:38.518
He seemed as scared as the children.

28
00:01:38.538 --> 00:01:40.719
"Who are you?"

29
00:01:41.439 --> 00:01:42.139
asked Mandy.

30
00:01:42.159 --> 00:01:45.980
"My name is Julio," he said.

31
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.261
"That man, Martin Alonzo, is my uncle.

32
00:01:50.542 --> 00:01:51.922
I didn't want him to see me."

33
00:01:53.262 --> 00:01:55.683
Julio looked about 18 years old.

34
00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:59.104
The children introduced themselves.

35
00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.401
"Why were you hiding?"

36
00:02:01.801 --> 00:02:02.481
asked Vinnie.

37
00:02:03.482 --> 00:02:04.983
Julio looked embarrassed.

38
00:02:06.064 --> 00:02:08.425
"Today we sail and I was scared."

39
00:02:08.445 --> 00:02:13.348
"Are you sailing with someone named Christopher Columbus?"

40
00:02:13.908 --> 00:02:14.589
asked Vinnie.

41
00:02:15.849 --> 00:02:16.710
Julio nodded.

42
00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.732
"Wow!" cried Vinnie.

43
00:02:19.752 --> 00:02:22.493
"He's a great explorer!"

44
00:02:22.513 --> 00:02:25.195
"He is crazy!"

45
00:02:25.775 --> 00:02:26.576
said Julio.

46
00:02:27.712 --> 00:02:30.373
"He thinks we can find the Indies by sailing west."

47
00:02:30.393 --> 00:02:34.535
"Columbus knows what he's doing," said Vinnie.

48
00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.176
Julio shook his head.

49
00:02:37.196 --> 00:02:40.517
"Columbus planned this journey many years ago.

50
00:02:41.498 --> 00:02:45.119
But nobody wanted to support him, not even Queen Isabella.

51
00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:51.802
But now that Spain is a powerful nation again, the queen and King Ferdinand said yes."

52
00:02:51.822 --> 00:02:56.084
"What if Columbus discovers something great?

53
00:02:57.428 --> 00:03:00.991
There's only one way to find out," Mandy said.

54
00:03:01.011 --> 00:03:04.513
"He DID discover something great.

55
00:03:05.694 --> 00:03:07.715
America!" Vinnie said.

56
00:03:07.735 --> 00:03:11.297
"The Portuguese travel around Africa.

57
00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:17.101
They reach the Indies going east without any problems," said Julio.

58
00:03:17.121 --> 00:03:22.845
"When people heard of Columbus' crazy plan, no one wanted to sail with him."

59
00:03:22.865 --> 00:03:26.528
"So why are you going on the voyage?"

60
00:03:27.108 --> 00:03:27.789
asked Vinnie.

61
00:03:29.009 --> 00:03:30.490
Julio's face softened.

62
00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:33.552
"My uncles are the Pinzon brothers.

63
00:03:34.852 --> 00:03:37.414
Everybody here in the port of Palos respects them.

64
00:03:38.635 --> 00:03:42.257
When they decided to support Columbus, the sailors decided to go.

65
00:03:43.497 --> 00:03:45.318
I couldn't be the only one to say no."

66
00:03:45.338 --> 00:03:48.520
"How many uncles do you have?"

67
00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:49.661
asked Vinnie.

68
00:03:49.681 --> 00:03:52.622
"Three," replied Julio.

69
00:03:52.642 --> 00:03:55.324
"They are all very capable seamen.

70
00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.503
I came to the church today to pray for a safe voyage.

71
00:04:00.604 --> 00:04:02.585
I didn't expect my uncle to be here.

72
00:04:03.907 --> 00:04:06.689
If he knew I was scared, he would call me a baby."

73
00:04:06.709 --> 00:04:09.752
"So when are you leaving?"

74
00:04:10.332 --> 00:04:11.033
asked Mandy.

75
00:04:11.053 --> 00:04:14.836
"In a few hours," replied Julio.

76
00:04:14.857 --> 00:04:16.978
"I am ready now.

77
00:04:17.299 --> 00:04:18.500
I must get to my ship."
